  {
    "type": "CompositeElement",
    "element_id": "76b25fab9c49a45425eca42617edde48",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2024-016_New-setpoint-adjuster-Pressure-Switches_1R0. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. Stay in touch!   Sign up for our newsletter.   Receive the DUNGS newsletter 6-8 times   a year with information on all aspects of   gas safety- and control technology.  \n\nSign up (English version)     \n\nRep→news  \n\n  \n\n2024-12-03 | #016  \n\nPressure Switches - Changes on setpoint adjuster\n\nAll DUNGS pressure switches will be equipped with a new setpoint adjuster design in 2025. Our target is to standardize the colors and materials between the different pressure switch models.",
