  {
    "type": "CompositeElement",
    "element_id": "07d737ca75d928ae0df9578a02890ac9",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2024-016_New-setpoint-adjuster-Pressure-Switches_1R0. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. For the European versions we additionally need to change the units on the setpoint adjuster from mbar to Pa/kPa, to fulfill the requirements of the new release of the EN 1854:2022. At all European pressure switches we add the order numbers on the dial. Versions used for single or bulk packages will have both order numbers on the dial.\n\nThe American versions have a design update to show all certifications with a new arrangement of the data.",
