  {
    "type": "CompositeElement",
    "element_id": "a869a6ab7006ecbf52419f0e481bf034",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2024-016_New-setpoint-adjuster-Pressure-Switches_1R0. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. To achieve this, DUNGS has invested in modern production technology and our conversion plan is as follows:\n\n1. We will start in February 2025 with the versions:\n\n- Pressure switches with manual reset\n\nGGW\n\nLGW /2. .\n\n- ATEX pressure switches\n\n- Pressure switches with American approvals\n\n2. Further products will follow in April 2025:\n\nGW... A4\n\nKS...\n\nLGW...Al...\n\nLGW...A2...\n\nLGW...A4...\n\n3. The end of the changeover is planned for July 2025 with the following pressure switches:\n\nGW... A5...\n\nGW... AG...",
