    "element_id": "559642d233151b47b2dc5878d6a68d5b",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2024-016_New-setpoint-adjuster-Pressure-Switches_1R0. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. Pictures of the new setpoint adjusters\n\nAA-A2: Pressure switch for American market:\n\n- Adapted new blue or yellow colour on all air or gas pressure switches in combination with black setting wheel\n\n- New arrangement of the data\n\n- Pressure unit: In.W.C/PSI\n\n1R0\n\n2/3\n\nRep→news  \n\n  \n\n2024-12-03 | #016  \n\nNB…A4: Pressure switch for European market:\n\n- Adapted new blue or yellow colour on all air or gas pressure switches in combination with black setting wheel\n\n- New arrangement of the data",
