  {
    "type": "CompositeElement",
    "element_id": "59b2a36c38eb8ff25fbae4b682aa5d96",
    "text": "Dieser Text ist für Produt: 2024-016_New-setpoint-adjuster-Pressure-Switches_1R0. Produkt ID: RepNews. Der Dokumentyp is RepNews. - Pressure unit on setting wheel: Pa/kPa\n\n- Specification of the conversion factor kPa/mbar or Pa/mbar\n\n- Maximum operating pressure unit: kPa\n\n- Specification of the order number\n\nTo avoid errors when replacing the pressure switches, the European pressure switch is supplied with a “Attention: Change of pressure unit” sticker for 2 years.\n\n1R0\n\n3/3",
